Brink Design knocked it out of the park with our LifeLight Festival app. They built a smooth, user-friendly mobile experience that helped attendees stay connected with schedules, artist lineups, maps, and real-time updates. It made a huge difference during the event. Their team understood our vision and brought it to life with clean design and powerful features. Plus, they were responsive, professional, and great to work with every step of the way. We couldn’t be happier with the result.
